#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/ascend/language/kernel/index.rst:127
msgid ""
"Number of active AIV sub-cores (1 or 2). Default is 2. On dav-3510, mixed "
"kernels always launch the physical ``__mix__(1, 2)`` group; ``sids=1`` "
"restricts the vector body to sub-core 0. Binds as ``sid`` via "
"``asc_get_sub_block_id()`` in generated code."
msgstr ""

